---
layout: base.njk
activeSection: explore
title: "GIS Maps of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve | MHTR"
description: "High-resolution public GIS maps for Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve: boundary context, terrain, hydrology, elevation and land-cover habitat."
keywords: "MHTR GIS maps, Mukundara Hills map, Mukundara hydrology map, Mukundara terrain map, Mukundara land cover, Bhainsrodgarh MHTR core"
og_title: "GIS Maps of Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve"
og_description: "Boundary, terrain, hydrology, elevation and land-cover maps for public landscape understanding."
og_image: "https://mhtr.in/assets/imgs/maps/mhtr-terrain-relief-map-preview.jpg"
